[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 16320.55, "timestamp": "04:32:00", "text": "すべてうまくいったので、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16324.63, "timestamp": "04:32:04", "text": "3、4セット滞在しました。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 16325.559, "timestamp": "04:32:05", "author": "@kronosMonke", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/u5R_PAWdwUdS05VsH3X9UsOPhhDkvp9L56mdw35mAubmJfUNuvcEeYcJ70Z5Hh_SFtAZe4NL2w=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "a concerts primary audience is adults tho"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16328.149, "timestamp": "04:32:08", "text": "知らなかった。私は彼のことを知らなかった"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16330.63, "timestamp": "04:32:10", "text": "父は車の中で待っていた。貧しい、貧しい"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16334.71, "timestamp": "04:32:14", "text": "かわいそうな叔父さんは車の中で待っていた"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16337.349, "timestamp": "04:32:17", "text": "携帯電話で「いいね」をしたり、エアコンをつけたり"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 16338.686, "timestamp": "04:32:18", "author": "@kronosMonke", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/u5R_PAWdwUdS05VsH3X9UsOPhhDkvp9L56mdw35mAubmJfUNuvcEeYcJ70Z5Hh_SFtAZe4NL2w=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "he meant good for u guys, but i find it odd"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16340.07, "timestamp": "04:32:20", "text": "そして、まるでそこに何もなかったかのように"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16342.79, "timestamp": "04:32:22", "text": "店舗や近隣のどの店でも構いません。その"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16345.71, "timestamp": "04:32:25", "text": "遠く離れていて孤立しているような感じ"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 16363.836, "timestamp": "04:32:43", "author": "@kronosMonke", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/u5R_PAWdwUdS05VsH3X9UsOPhhDkvp9L56mdw35mAubmJfUNuvcEeYcJ70Z5Hh_SFtAZe4NL2w=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "ofc tho, if they were smoking right on the venue, then thats weird"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16364.55, "timestamp": "04:32:44", "text": "歌。でも、それは私の"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16368.79, "timestamp": "04:32:48", "text": "私が初めて参加したコンサート、DJコン、DJギグ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16371.91, "timestamp": "04:32:51", "text": "体験に耳を傾けた。 